#### [API: cli](#api-cli)
<hr class="section-rule lvl-4">

The reusable subcommand-dispatch engine behind every `compose.mk` subcommand CLI (see [Subcommands]({{_}}/subcommands)).  The `cmk` / `cli` front-ends and the `@cli.subcommands` decorator are all thin clients of this one target; the `cli.cmk.*` implementation targets are intentionally omitted here.

